    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f690e678b950e283cf607d37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时具备这两点，才能增加存在的厚度，\n进而令人沉醉其中……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50ec05c45c6ef44dc980caafdf61b23e70d7cf1bd52bcb645686f58010f74a96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
