    {
      "uid": "zhcn:456832dcfd0b0195b28a670f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，我便不会犹豫是否该追求两者！\n真我，我──将会把二冠收入囊中！\n呵呵，哈哈哈！啊──哈哈哈！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3c1ffa01f9f23793a720521f743f8b842e70af2ec763512667367dccfd78861",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
