      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实在搞不太懂……\n最后我只理解“速度”跟“力量”\n这两个单字的意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "418da557559b5f52c3aaa72a7f703ceb17e03070ed4302d04642371ab11777b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0145/storytimeline_830145001.json",
      "json_path": [
