      "uid": "zhcn:0d175e11e690dc76dd8a0b0e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我现在明白……\n她对“速度”与“力量”有独到的要求。\n如果是她的话，或许能达成某种全新的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84b55b222814c7cdefb9c80765d390f3645d025ee4dcfae3acf77df6ffd2cb12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
